 E. Lactation facilities in US radiology practices. J Am Coll Radiol. 2017;14:733–736. doi: 10.1016/j.jacr.2016.11.025. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 10. Belkacemi Y., Loaganadane G., Grellier N., Fonteneau G., Zaoui G., Coraggio G. Radiation therapy department reorganization during the coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19) outbreak: keys to securing staff and patients during the first weeks of the crisis and impact on radiation therapy practice from a single institution experience. Adv Radiat Oncol. 2020 doi: 10.1016/j.adro.2020.04.039. In Press. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 11. Noticewala S.S., Koong A.C., Bloom E.S., Choi S., Chronowski G., Ghafar R.A. Radiation oncology strategies to flatten the curve during the coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19) pandemic: experience from a large tertiary cancer center. Adv Radiat Oncol. 2020;21:567–572. doi: 10.1016/j.adro.2020.04.038. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 12. Radiology ABR Coronavirus information. https://www.theabr.org/announcements/coronavirus-updates 13. @RadOncVVPN Network VVP. Oncology UoCDoR. https://twitter.com/RadOncVVPN 14. Mohammadi H., De Leo A.N., Asher D., Malouff T.D., Waddle M.R., Figura N.B. The Florida radiation oncology resident experience during Coronavirus-19: perspectives and recommendations. Adv Radiat Oncol. 2020 doi: 10.1016/j.adro.2020.05.002. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 15. Whelan A., Prescott J., Young G., Catanese V.M., McKinney R. Guidance on medical students'' participation in direct patient contact activities. 2020. https://www.aamc.org/system/files/2020-04/meded-April-14-Guidance-on-Medical-Students-Participation-in-Direct-Patient-Contact-Activities.pdf 16. Durst M., Ellithorpe M., Shin K., Curran N., Bruncko D., Cerjanic A. UMSC open letter to the heads of NBME and FSMB on ongoing disruptions to USMLE step 1, step 2CS and step 2CK exams. 2020. https://uofi.app.box.com/s/lvb8w7n6jq5ulk177nq3